oach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-16T14:25:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T13:48:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026-27 Week 11 College Football Playoff, bowl projections","description":"Our bowl gurus take a look at how the postseason picture shifted after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:28:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473016/2026-week-11-college-football-playoff-bowl-projections","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura and Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football takeaways: Lasting impressions from Week 11","description":"Our college football experts break down the most important things they saw in Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:21:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/mondaytakeaways111626/2026-college-football-takeaways-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Power Rankings: The top teams hold their positions in Week 11","description":"Check out how Week 11 caused shifts in this week's top 25.","published":"2026-11-16T12:12:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473507/2026-college-football-power-rankings-top-25-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Florida State's first turquoise football uniforms are a tribute to Seminole Tribe","description":"Florida State's turquoise uniforms are a tribute to the Seminole Tribe of Florida.","published":"2026-11-16T01:03:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50495730/florida-state-football-turquoise-uniforms-seminole-tribe","type":"Story","byline":"Anthony Gharib","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Source: Tennessee leading receiver Mike Matthews out for season","description":"Mike Matthews sustained the injury during Tennessee's win Saturday at Texas A&M.","published":"2026-11-16T00:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50496356/tennessee-leading-receiver-mike-matthews-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma, boosted by crowd's ire at postponement, beats No. 19 Ole Miss","description":"The Oklahoma crowd let Ole Miss know what they thought of having their game delayed by a day, and the Sooners rode that energy to a 24-17 win over the Rebels.","published":"2026-11-16T00:22:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50495687/sooners-boosted-crowd-ire-postponement-beat-rebels","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4702828/aj-holmes-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A._J._Holmes_Jr."},"pick":{"pick":56,"round":2,"team":"ATL","via":"JAX","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"A. J. Holmes Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A._J._Holmes_Jr.","description":"American football player (born 2003)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:27Z","intro":"Anthony \"A. J.\" Holmes Jr. (born November 7, 2003) is an American college football defensive tackle for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Houston Cougars.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Holmes Jr. attended Westfield High School in Houston, Texas. As a senior season, he was named the District 14-6A MVP. Coming out of high school, Holmes Jr. committed to play college football for the Houston Cougars over other offers from schools such as TCU, Kansas State, Washington State, SMU, and Virginia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"HOUSTON\nDuring his freshman season in 2022, Holmes Jr. notched six tackles with half a tackle being for a loss. In the 2023 season, he appeared in 12 games with three starts, where he totaled 21 tackles with four and a half going for a loss, and two and a half sacks. During the 2024 season, Holmes Jr. tallied 40 tackles with eight and a half being for a loss, and two sacks. After the season, he entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nHolmes Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. In week 2 of the 2025 season, he notched four tackles with two being for a loss, a sack, a pass deflection, and a fumble recovery in a blowout win over Kent State. In week 6, Holmes Jr. recorded two sacks in a win versus Kansas. In week 7, he recorded a sack against Arizona State. For his performance during the 2025 season, Holmes Jr. was named a first-team All-American by Pro Football Focus."}]}}